schway-screen 1
screen startup-auth
title Startup sign-in needed
description A reopened conversation without credentials offers sign-in before any task is sent.
variant nocolor-dark-120
size 120x30
cursor 7 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

  ▌ You
  ▌ Explain the config loader


  It merges defaults, user and project settings.

  ▌ ! Error
  ▌ Sign-in needed · Connect to continue
  ▌ Alt+L sign in · F2 details · Esc keep editing














